.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-project-add 1  "mnnn-project-add 2.8.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-project\-add \- Add a live search, a journal, a report, a rule, a model, a code space or a result (a series, optionally a time range) to a project
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn project add\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-search\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-rule\fR] [\fB\-\-journal\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-report\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-code\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-result\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a live search, a journal, a report, a rule, a model, a code space or a result (a series, optionally a time range) to a project
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-search\fR \fI<SEARCH>\fR
Live search id or name
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-rule\fR \fI<RULE>\fR
Rule id or name
.TP
\fB\-\-journal\fR \fI<JOURNAL>\fR
Journal id or name
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-report\fR \fI<REPORT>\fR
Report id or name
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Model id or name
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-code\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Code space id or name
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-result\fR \fI<SERIES>\fR
A series as SOURCE:SYMBOL:PERIOD, e.g. binance:BTC/USDT:5m
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Result time range start
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Result time range end
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.8.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
